  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p data-start=\"133\" data-end=\"156\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"133\" data-end=\"156\">Brand Introduction:</strong></p><p data-start=\"158\" data-end=\"270\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FZKL is a performance wellness lifestyle brand dedicated to empowering athletically-minded individuals to achieve their best in fitness, sport, and life.</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">We offer a comprehensive range of high-quality supplements, apparel, and accessories designed to support optimal performance and recovery.</span></p><p data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"296\"><strong data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"296\">Product Description:</strong></p><p data-start=\"298\" data-end=\"454\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Our product lineup includes advanced supplements such as Super Collagen, Super Plant Protein, and NANO LOCKED-IN: Brain &amp; Performance Fuel.</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">These products are formulated to enhance muscle recovery, joint health, cognitive function, and overall well-being.</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">In addition to supplements, we provide premium activewear that combines comfort and functionality, catering to both men and women.</span></p><p data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"489\"><strong data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"489\">Unique Selling Points (USPs):</strong></p><ul data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"811\"><li data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"596\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"596\"><strong data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"517\">Tru Nano Technology:</strong> Our proprietary nano emulsification process increases bioavailability up to 99%, making our supplements up to 10 times more effective than traditional options.</p></li><li data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"701\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"701\"><strong data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"622\">Clean Ingredients:</strong> We prioritize clean, non-GMO, and gluten-free ingredients, ensuring our products are suitable for a wide range of dietary needs.</p></li><li data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"811\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"811\"><strong data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"732\">Comprehensive Wellness:</strong> FZKL offers solutions that address various aspects of health, including inflammation support, stress relief, and enhanced focus, providing a holistic approach to wellness.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"835\"><strong data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"835\">Other Information:</strong></p><p data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"955\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FZKL is more than just a brand; it's a community committed to fostering a supportive environment for individuals striving for excellence in their fitness journeys.</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Our products are designed to integrate seamlessly into daily routines, providing the necessary support for both physical and mental performance.</span></p><p data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"1075\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Join us in promoting a lifestyle of health, strength, and resilience.</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">With FZKL, affiliates have the opportunity to align with a brand that values quality, innovation, and community.</span></p></div></div>",
